usage: course status [-h] [--root DIR] [--lab GROUP]
                     [--status {predicted,unverified,corrected,identical,verified,written}]
                     [--json]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root DIR            niagara-research checkout (default: $NIAGARA_RESEARCH_DIR, then found from
                        cwd)
  --lab GROUP           one group: a lab number (3 or L3), B, A, RA1, RA2, RAX, RA (all three),
                        EXAM
  --status {predicted,unverified,corrected,identical,verified,written}
                        list the items carrying this status (written = no marker)
  --json                machine JSON output
